  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Morus nigra",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morus_nigra",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1372842689,
      "text": "Morus nigra, or the black mulberry, is a species of flowering plant in the family Moraceae that is native to southwestern Asia, where it has been cultivated for so long that its precise natural range is unknown. The black mulberry is known for its large number of chromosomes."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Morus nigra",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morus_nigra",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 175096648,
      "text": "Morus nigra, morera negra o moral negro es una especie de árbol perteneciente a la familia de las moráceas, nativa del sudoeste de Asia, siendo cultivada por tan largo periodo que su rango natural preciso es desconocido."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Mûrier noir",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%BBrier_noir",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 233127400,
      "text": "Le mûrier noir est une espèce d'arbres fruitiers originaire d'Asie occidentale et naturalisée en Amérique du Nord, en Europe et en Chine et appartenant à la famille des Moracées."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Morus nigra",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morus_nigra",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 68982122,
      "text": "A Morus nigra, commumente conhecida como amoreira-negra, é uma da espécie de árvore da família das Moráceas, que produz frutos comestíveis, de coloração vermelho-escura, que dão pelos nomes comuns de amora-preta, amora-miúra e amora-da-horta, e cujas folhas amiúde se destinam à alimentação do bicho-da-seda."
    }
  },
